# The bounce ability needs a creature to target (CR 601.2c): on turn 3 no creature is on the battlefield and the
# ability is not offered. Bot2's Ornithopter arrives on turn 4 and the same ability, activated on turn 5, is the
# positive control: the Ornithopter returns to Bot2's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Aether Spellbomb
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Aether Spellbomb.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Aether Spellbomb.Activate(Ability: Return target creature)
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Aether Spellbomb.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Return target creature)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Aether Spellbomb
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Stack.Count = 0
